.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH SPT-OBSERVE 1  "observe " 
.SH NAME
observe \- Metrics and Windows Event Log helpers
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBobserve\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Metrics and Windows Event Log helpers
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
observe\-metrics(1)
Print metrics
.TP
observe\-windows\-event(1)
Windows Event Log integration
.TP
observe\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  spt observe metrics \-\-format prometheus
  spt observe windows\-event install\-source \-\-source SshPermaTunnel
  spt observe windows\-event test \-\-source SshPermaTunnel
